.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-list-profiles 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-list\-profiles \- Emits a list of profiles supported by the identified subcommand
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop list\-profiles\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISUBCOMMAND\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Emits a list of profiles supported by the identified subcommand
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISUBCOMMAND\fR>

